		<description><![CDATA[ALT TEXT, Mathieu Tremblin, 2015, San Francisco (USA) as part of &#8220;F.A.T. GOLD&#8221; at Gray Area. Laser cutted plastic, adhesive tape, various sizes. Special thanks to Stochastic Lab, Steve Thomson, Becky Stern and David Renault. Our URL life is fucked up? Let&#8217;s go for IRL Internet experience! &#160;]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>ALT TEXT, Mathieu Tremblin, 2015, San Francisco (USA) as part of &#8220;F.A.T. GOLD&#8221; at Gray Area.<br />
Laser cutted plastic, adhesive tape, various sizes.<br />
Special thanks to Stochastic Lab, Steve Thomson, Becky Stern and David Renault.</p>
<p><a href="http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_MISSIONSTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1081.jpg"><img class="alignnone  wp-image-11869" src="http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_MISSIONSTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1081-720x480.jpg" alt="2015_ALTTEXT_MISSIONSTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1081" width="355" height="228" /></a></p>
<p>Our URL life is fucked up?<br />
Let&#8217;s go for IRL Internet experience!</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_PINESTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1226.jpg"><img class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-11870" src="http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_PINESTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1226-720x480.jpg" alt="2015_ALTTEXT_PINESTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1226" width="720" height="480" srcset="http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_PINESTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1226-720x480.jpg 720w, http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_PINESTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1226-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_PINESTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1226-740x493.jpg 740w, http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_PINESTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1226.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_20THSTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1044.jpg"><img class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-11860" src="http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_20THSTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1044-720x480.jpg" alt="2015_ALTTEXT_20THSTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1044" width="720" height="480" srcset="http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_20THSTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1044-720x480.jpg 720w, http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_20THSTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1044-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_20THSTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1044-740x493.jpg 740w, http://fffff.at/files/2015/06/2015_ALTTEXT_20THSTREET_DOCUMENTATION_SANFRANCISCO_MATHIEUTREMBLIN_IMG_1044.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px" /></a></p>
